-| Editions | CMS, public DOM, mint configuration/metadata (external), chain econ reads | Re-entered; semantics differ | CMS currently owns curated display | Authoring record stores intended edition count with semantic label; mint verification records observed chain value separately | Payload/output yes; observed value captured | `$ACID`, copy, mint quantity, and chain mismatch |
